    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"These data files are in an ASCII format provided by the original contractors.  Most of these data were collected as part of the National Uranium Resource Evaluation (NURE) Program of the U.S. Department of Energy.  The aerial surveys were flown during the period of time from 1975 to 1983.  The various aerial surveys were flown by different contractors and the ASCII formats provided by the contractors are different.\"",
